<body><{\f1 \uc0\u9443 }<<Helvetica.ttf><12pts>{\f1 \uc0\u9400 }<#000000> \ql Subject: NOTICE OF SETTLEMENT: You may be entitled to a payment from the Apex Technologies Data Breach\line \line Case Name: In re: Apex Technologies Consumer Data Privacy Litigation Case Number: 4:24-cv-01983-JST\line \line Dear Massimo,\line \line You are receiving this email because records indicate that you may have been a customer of Apex Technologies between January 2021 and December 2023.\line \line A proposed settlement has been reached in a class action lawsuit against Apex Technologies Inc. The lawsuit claims that the company failed to adequately protect consumer data during a security breach that occurred in late 2023. Apex Technologies denies all wrongdoing but has agreed to settle the claims to avoid the cost and distraction of ongoing litigation.\line \line WHAT YOU MAY RECEIVE\line \line If you are a member of the Settlement Class, you may be eligible to receive a cash payment estimated between $50.00 and $250.00, depending on the number of valid claims filed.\line \line HOW TO FILE A CLAIM\line \line To receive a payment, you must submit a valid Claim Form by November 15, 2026. You can file your claim online by visiting the official settlement website at www.ApexDataSettlement.com and entering your unique Claim ID below:\line \line Your Unique Claim ID: APX-99482-B\line \line YOUR LEGAL RIGHTS AND OPTIONS\line \line \u8226? File a Claim: Submit a claim by November 15, 2026, to receive a payment.\line \line \u8226? Do Nothing: Receive no payment and give up your right to sue Apex Technologies regarding this matter.\line \line \u8226? Exclude Yourself: Opt out of the settlement by October 1, 2026. You will receive no payment, but you will retain your right to sue the company separately.\line \line For more information, please visit the settlement website or call the Settlement Administrator at 1-800-555-0199.\line \line Sincerely,\line \line The Apex Settlement Administrator>